Spec: Durable review intent receipt

Purpose:
  Retain one unresolved operation across console failures under an exclusive private-state lease.

Owns:
  ./ReviewIntentFile.cs

Must:
  Reject linked paths, hold a non-shared file lease and use bounded strict JSON receipts containing only operation references and versions.
  Require a protected Broker state directory and reject receipt or lease ACLs granting access outside the current user and SYSTEM.
  Flush a private temporary file before atomic replacement; never overwrite an unresolved receipt or automatically reset corrupt state.
  Acknowledge only the expected operation and preserve the receipt when any write fails.
  Retain the last acknowledged reference until a new explicitly confirmed operation is prepared.
